{
  "id": "s5-when-did-you-know",
  "title": "職位不是我",
  "lines": [
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "雨澄看了我幾秒，把手收回膝上。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "admit" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "好。那我還能決定什麼？", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "admit" }] },

    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "繼續。原因先說完，文件等一下看。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "deflect" }] },
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "她把資料夾往雅琳的方向推了半寸。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "deflect" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "後面的問題先由雅琳記。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "deflect" }] },
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "雅琳點頭，在平板上另開一頁。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "deflect" }] },

    { "speaker": "zeng-yalin", "text": "周主管，這句不在核准資訊裡。沒有保留職位的轉圜方案。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "bargain" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "所以根本沒有轉圜，還要我先配合流程？", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "bargain" }] },
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "我想接話，雨澄已經轉過頭來。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "bargain" }] },

    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "你什麼時候知道的？" },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "兩週前知道公司在評估。今天下午拿到最終名單。" },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "上週你還說，下季會有新安排。" }
  ],
  "choices": [],
  "next": "s5-echo-router"
}
